<title>USA: Ark. $39 mln agency deal yields 5.42 pct in 2011.</title>
<headline>Ark. $39 mln agency deal yields 5.42 pct in 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Llama Co said Wednesday it tentatively priced $39.1 million Arkansas Development Finance Authority bonds at a top yield of 5.42 percent in 2011.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>ARKANSAS DEVELOPMENT FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
